# Conformance probe pack for the `sixbit` transform (spec 0.14) on a hex
# `bits` message in `lsb` order. Public. Characters are read first to last,
# each one's six bits low bit first.
format        conformance-sixbit-lsb
version       0.14.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          bits
word_bytes    2
bit_order     lsb

field    probe.s1     0:0:12    sixbit
field    probe.n      0:12:4    uint
